      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This idea assumes everyone will accurately tag their worlds and avatars. We've already seen with other tags that this doesn't happen, very few people tag their worlds and avatars accurately.\n\nVRChat would need to take a more firm approach with users not tagging things accurately.",
