      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Its easier to moderate missing or wrong tags once a world gains more traction where deceit would impact more people. An AI tag makes sense, because if you make a world/avatar it will say \"Made by Author\", same should apply when an AI makes something, so the tag makes sense and should be enforced.",
